ULTRARAG ATTRIBUTION

Memory UltraRAG MCP is an independent MCP server inspired by UltraRAG's modular
MCP architecture. Its planned semantic-retrieval adapter is designed to run a
verified, unmodified UltraRAG retriever snapshot through UltraRAG's public MCP
interface. No UltraRAG source code is currently copied into or modified by this
repository.

UltraRAG is developed by its team and contributors, including participants from:

- THUNLP at Tsinghua University: https://nlp.csai.tsinghua.edu.cn/
- NEUIR at Northeastern University: https://neuir.github.io/
- OpenBMB: https://www.openbmb.cn/home
- AI9stars: https://github.com/AI9Stars
- The wider contributor community:
  https://github.com/OpenBMB/UltraRAG/graphs/contributors

Canonical project: https://github.com/OpenBMB/UltraRAG
Documentation: https://ultrarag.openbmb.cn/

